## [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l3mLyvXbJ_eKr_evlp3Ux1-DepKYOOgbv1c4aPaM2iM/edit?usp=sharing](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l3mLyvXbJ_eKr_evlp3Ux1-DepKYOOgbv1c4aPaM2iM/edit?usp=sharing)
**This is a Frame that provides a guideline as to how to have a conversation. Most calls won't go through the thing as smoothly. You'll need to apply your communication skills to talk to the prospect and take them through the setting journey.**
**Don't just say all of this word for word in order**
